helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\01020100.xhp	0	help	par_id3155072	30			0	kid	u2t]f4‖The \<emph\>Option Explicit\</emph\> statement has to be the first line in the module, before the first SUB. Generally, only arrays need to be declared explicitly. All other variables are declared according to the type-declaration character, or - if omitted - as the default type \<emph\>Single\</emph\>.				20130829 23:02:48
