helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\01020100.xhp	0	help	par_id3153972	36			0	kid	oac[v0‖\<emph\>Numeric\</emph\> variables can contain number values. Some variables are used to store large or small numbers, and others are used for floating-point or fractional numbers. 				20130829 23:02:48
