helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\01020100.xhp	0	help	par_id3153337	96			0	kid	+tb4sj‖Currency variables are internally stored as 64-bit numbers (8 Bytes) and displayed as a fixed-decimal number with 15 non-decimal and 4 decimal places. The values range from -922337203685477.5808 to +922337203685477.5807. Currency variables are used to calculate currency values with a high precision. The type-declaration character is "@".				20130829 23:02:48
