helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\01030300.xhp	0	help	par_id3146986	16			0	kid	ynl7nz‖The values of variables are only displayed if they are in scope. Variables that are not defined at the current source code location display ("Out of Scope") instead of a value.				20130829 23:02:48
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\01030300.xhp	0	help	par_id3145272	17			0	kid	xd=qb2‖You can also include arrays in the Watch window. If you enter the name of an array variable without an index value in the Watch text box, the content of the entire array is displayed.				20130829 23:02:48
