helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060109.xhp	0	help	par_id3149711	193			0	kid	+bebcm‖\<ahelp hid=\"HID_FUNC_SPALTE\"\>Returns the column number of a cell reference.\</ahelp\> If the reference is a cell the column number of the cell is returned; if the parameter is a cell area, the corresponding column numbers are returned in a single-row \<link href=\"text/scalc/01/04060107.xhp#wasmatrix\" name=\"array\"\>array\</link\> if the formula is entered \<link href=\"text/scalc/01/04060107.xhp#somatrixformel\" name=\"as an array formula\"\>as an array formula\</link\>. If the COLUMN function with an area reference parameter is not used for an array formula, only the column number of the first cell within the area is determined.				20130829 23:02:48
