helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060109.xhp	0	help	par_id8056886				0	kid	siclad‖Since STYLE() has a numeric return value of zero, this return value gets appended to a string. This can be avoided using T() as in the following example 				20130829 23:02:48
