helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060109.xhp	0	help	par_idN11811				0	kid	zz9u+z‖            \<emph\>URL\</emph\> specifies the link target. The optional \<emph\>CellText\</emph\> parameter is the text or a number that is displayed in the cell and will be returned as the result. If the \<emph\>CellText\</emph\> parameter is not specified, the \<emph\>URL\</emph\> is displayed in the cell text and will be returned as the result.				20130829 23:02:48
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060109.xhp	0	help	par_id0907200912224576				0	kid	v]h2p7‖The number 0 is returned for empty cells and matrix elements.				20130829 23:02:48
