helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060109.xhp	0	help	par_idN11827				0	kid	lq4va4‖            \<item type=\"input\"\>=HYPERLINK("http://www.example.org")\</item\> displays the text "http://www.example.org" in the cell and executes the hyperlink http://www.example.org when clicked.				20130829 23:02:48
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060109.xhp	0	help	par_idN1182A				0	kid	vus]f]‖            \<item type=\"input\"\>=HYPERLINK("http://www.example.org";"Click here")\</item\> displays the text "Click here" in the cell and executes the hyperlink http://www.example.org when clicked.				20130829 23:02:48
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060109.xhp	0	help	par_id0907200912224534				0	kid	j184dc‖=HYPERLINK("http://www.example.org";12345) displays the number 12345 and executes the hyperlink http://www.example.org when clicked.				20130829 23:02:48
