helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060109.xhp	0	help	par_idN11830				0	kid	7wx8l4‖            \<item type=\"input\"\>=HYPERLINK("http://www.";"Click ") & "example.org"\</item\> displays the text Click example.org in the cell and executes the hyperlink http://www.example.org when clicked.				20130829 23:02:48
