helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060102.xhp	0	help	par_id3149720	183			0	kid	37]-s6‖In \<emph\>\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>%PRODUCTNAME - Preferences\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Tools - Options\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> - $[officename] - General\</emph\> you find the area \<emph\>Year (two digits)\</emph\>. This sets the period for which two-digit information applies. Note that changes made here have an effect on some of the following functions.				20130829 23:02:48
