helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3151774	620			0	kid	cn1aju‖Example assumption: You have entered invoices into a table. Column A contains the date value of the invoice, column B the amounts. You want to find a formula that you can use to return the total of all amounts only for a specific month, e.g. only the amount for the period >=2008-01-01 to <2008-02-01. The range with the date values covers A1:A40, the range containing the amounts to be totaled is B1:B40. C1 contains the start date, 2008\<item type=\"input\"\>-01-01\</item\>, of the invoices to be included and C2 the date, 2008\<item type=\"input\"\>-02-01\</item\>, that is no longer included.				20130829 23:02:48
