helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3143782	569			0	kid	yj[vbv‖\<emph\>From_currency\</emph\> and \<emph\>To_currency\</emph\> are the currency units to convert from and to respectively. These must be text, the official abbreviation for the currency (for example, "EUR"). The rates (shown per Euro) were set by the European Commission.				20130829 23:02:48
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id0119200904301810				0	kid	myvd01‖\<emph\>Full_precision\</emph\> is optional. If omitted or False, the result is rounded according to the decimals of the To currency. If Full_precision is True, the result is not rounded.				20130829 23:02:48
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id0119200904301815				0	kid	op[7l4‖\<emph\>Triangulation_precision\</emph\> is optional. If Triangulation_precision is given and >=3, the intermediate result of a triangular conversion (currency1,EUR,currency2) is rounded to that precision. If Triangulation_precision is omitted, the intermediate result is not rounded. Also if To currency is "EUR", Triangulation_precision is used as if triangulation was needed and conversion from EUR to EUR was applied.				20130829 23:02:48
