helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\06060200.xhp	0	help	par_id3150717	9			0	kid	3sw2rq‖You can completely protect your work by combining both options from \<emph\>Tools - Protect Document\</emph\>, including password entry. If you want to prevent the document from being opened by other users, select \<emph\>Save With Password \</emph\>and click the \<emph\>Save\</emph\> button. The \<emph\>Enter Password\</emph\> dialog appears. Consider carefully when choosing a password; if you forget it after you close a document you will be unable to access the document.				20130829 23:02:48
