helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\goalseek.xhp	0	help	par_id3150871	4			0	kid	e4r4-2‖To calculate annual interest (I), create a table with the values for the capital (C), number of years (n), and interest rate (i). The formula is:				20130829 23:02:48
