helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\value_with_name.xhp	0	help	par_id328989				0	kid	gnb6zg‖Names must not be the same as cell references. For example, the name A1 is invalid because A1 is a cell reference to the top left cell.				20130829 23:02:48
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\value_with_name.xhp	0	help	par_id32898987				0	kid	aqz0]y‖Names must not start with the letter R followed by a number. See the ADDRESS function for more information.				20130829 23:02:48
