helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\format_value.xhp	0	help	par_id3148576	5			0	kid	o+ywna‖Enter a number into the sheet, for example, 1234.5678. This number will be displayed in the default number format, with two decimal places. You will see 1234.57 when you confirm the entry. Only the display in the document will be rounded off; internally, the number retains all four decimal places after the decimal point.				20130829 23:02:48
