helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\type_stock.xhp	0	help	par_id6138492				0	kid	20=]k-‖Choose the \<emph\>Stock\</emph\> chart type on the first page of the \<link href=\"text/schart/01/wiz_chart_type.xhp\"\>Chart wizard\</link\>. Then select one of the four variants.				20130829 23:02:48
