helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\wiz_data_range.xhp	0	help	par_id5626392				0	kid	ladmmb‖In Calc, an example data range would be "$Sheet1.$B$3:$B$14". Note that a data range may consist of more than one region in a spreadsheet, e.g. "$Sheet1.A1:A5;$Sheet1.D1:D5" is also a valid data range. In Writer, an example data range would be "Table1.A1:E4".				20130829 23:02:48
