helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\wiz_data_range.xhp	0	help	par_id953703				0	kid	6rdbqb‖\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Data series get their data from consecutive rows in the selected range. For scatter charts, the first data series will contain x-values for all series. All other data series are used as y-values, one for each series.\</ahelp\>				20130829 23:02:48
