helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\type_xy.xhp	0	help	par_id4634235				0	kid	2w672r‖The chart is created with default settings. After the chart is finished, you can edit its properties to change the appearance. Line styles and icons can be changed on the \<emph\>Line\</emph\>tab page of the data series properties dialog.				20130829 23:02:48
