helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000005.xhp	0	help	par_id3145116	167			0	kid	lwuo07‖The language is written with characters or glyphs that are composed of several parts				20130829 23:02:48
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000005.xhp	0	help	par_id3154630	168			0	kid	zpzbol‖The text direction is from right to left.				20130829 23:02:48
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000005.xhp	0	help	par_id3148677	170			0	kid	vt7iro‖Currently, $[officename] supports Hindi, Thai, Hebrew, and Arabic as CTL languages.				20130829 23:02:48
