helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000005.xhp	0	help	par_id3157874	165			0	kid	p2]avw‖IME stands for Input Method Editor. A program that allows the user to enter complex characters from non-western character sets using a standard keyboard.				20130829 23:02:48
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000005.xhp	0	help	bm_id3151172				0	kid	db5pa[‖\<bookmark_value\>JDBC; definition\</bookmark_value\>				20130829 23:02:48
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000005.xhp	0	help	hd_id3151172	111			0	kid	xr+zf=‖JDBC				20130829 23:02:48
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000005.xhp	0	help	par_id3148386	112			0	kid	t9bha9‖You can use the Java Database Connectivity (JDBC) API to connect to a database from %PRODUCTNAME. JDBC drivers are written in the Java programming language and are platform independent.				20130829 23:02:48
