helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000021.xhp	0	help	par_id3146907	1			0	kid	5d+i+i‖If you want to define another file format as the default, choose \<emph\>\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>%PRODUCTNAME - Preferences\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Tools - Options\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> - \<link href=\"text/shared/optionen/01010200.xhp\" name=\"Load/Save - General\"\>Load/Save - General\</link\>\</emph\> to find alternative file formats for each $[officename] document type.				20130829 23:02:48
