helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000001.xhp	0	help	par_id3145345	7			0	kid	6qwxp-‖You can enter values in the input fields in different units of measurement. The default unit is inches. However, if you want a space of exactly 1cm, then type "1cm". Additional units are available according to the context, for example, 12 pt for a 12 point spacing. If the value of the new unit is unrealistic, the program uses a predefined maximum or minimum value.				20130829 23:02:48
