helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12070000.xhp	0	help	par_id3156326	7			0	kid	r-z]=f‖\<switchinline select=\"appl\"\>\<caseinline select=\"WRITER\"\>If data is inserted into the document as a table, the table properties are not saved along with the data in the document. If you select the \<emph\>AutoFormat\</emph\> function for formatting the table, $[officename] will note the name of the format template. This template will then be used automatically if you insert data as a table again, unless the preferences have been changed.\</caseinline\>\</switchinline\>				20130829 23:02:48
