helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170102.xhp	0	help	par_id3159171	8			0	kid	tnnaxz‖\<ahelp hid=\"HID_PROP_LISTSOURCE\"\>With database forms, specifies the data source for the list content of the form-element. This field can be used to define a value list for documents without a database connection.\</ahelp\>				20130829 23:02:48
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170102.xhp	0	help	par_id3168456	15			0	kid	l[5]t3‖In the case of database forms, the data source determines the entries of the list or combo box. Depending on the selected type, you have a choice between different data sources under \<emph\>List content\</emph\>, provided that these objects exist in your database. All available database objects of the type selected under \<emph\>Type of list contents\</emph\> are offered here. If you have selected the "Value List" option as the type, you can use references for database forms. If the display of the control is controlled by an SQL command, the SQL statement is entered here.				20130829 23:02:48
