helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\02020000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154125	6			0	kid	46uyog‖If you receive an error message that states that certain fonts have not been found, you can install them with \<emph\>$[officename] Setup\</emph\> in the \<emph\>Repair\</emph\> mode if it is a $[officename] font.				20130829 23:02:48
