helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170103.xhp	0	help	par_id3153717	13			0	kid	5wp96w‖\<ahelp hid=\"HID_EVT_APPROVEACTIONPERFORMED\"\>This event takes place before an action is triggered by clicking the control.\</ahelp\> For example, clicking a "Submit" button initiates a send action; however, the actual "send" process is started only when the \<emph\>When initiating\</emph\> event occurs. The \<emph\>Approve action\</emph\> event allows you to kill the process. If the linked method sends back FALSE, \<emph\>When initiating\</emph\> will not be executed.				20130829 23:02:48
