helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_id3150378	46			0	kid	yx56g6‖When creating a form, an index is automatically assigned to the control fields that are added to this form; every control field added is assigned an index increased by 1. If you change the index of a control, the indices of the other controls are updated automatically. Elements that cannot be focused (Tabstop = No) are also assigned a value. However, these controls are skipped when using the Tab key.				20130829 23:02:48
