helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\01110200.xhp	0	help	par_id3152578	38			0	kid	9uv-][‖There are two possible options for exporting $[officename] Impress presentations using WebCast technology: Active Server Pages (ASP) and Perl.				20130829 23:02:48
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\01110200.xhp	0	help	par_id3153364	71			0	kid	sbhpzm‖In either case, the WebCast needs an HTTP server offering either Perl or ASP as scripting. Therefore, the exporting option depends on the HTTP server used.				20130829 23:02:48
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\01110200.xhp	0	help	hd_id3151112	39			0	kid	6eaj7v‖WebCast in ASP				20130829 23:02:48
