helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\spadmin.xhp	0	help	par_id3159157	122			0	kid	qaaer+‖Under UNIX based platforms, the $[officename] software only offers direct support for printers using the PostScript technology. Other printers must be set up as described in the section \<emph\>Printer Drivers in the $[officename] Software\</emph\>. The $[officename] software automatically provides a printer with the default driver for each system queue. You can add additional printers as needed.				20130829 23:02:48
