helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\spadmin.xhp	0	help	par_id3156284	22			0	kid	a64z]r‖In the printer administration program \<emph\>spadmin\</emph\>, select the printer from the \<emph\>Installed printers\</emph\> list box and click \<emph\>Properties\</emph\>. The \<emph\>Properties\</emph\> dialog appears containing several tab pages. This is where you can make settings that are used according to the PPD file of the selected printer.				20130829 23:02:48
