helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\error_report.xhp	0	help	par_id3147088	2			0	kid	0m4sq=‖The Error Report Tool gathers all necessary information that can help the program developers to improve the code, so that in later versions this error can possibly be avoided. Please help us to improve the software and send the generated error report.				20130829 23:02:48
