helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\error_report.xhp	0	help	par_id3147335	8			0	kid	p5kz+d‖On the main Error Report Tool dialog, you can enter some additional information that may help the developers to localize the error. For example, if the error only appears after a change in your hardware or software environment, or if you clicked on a button, please include that information.				20130829 23:02:48
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\error_report.xhp	0	help	hd_id3159399	9			0	kid	evufvg‖Sending the Error Report				20130829 23:02:48
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\error_report.xhp	0	help	par_id3150504	10			0	kid	du=ajh‖The Error Report Tool uses the HTTP PUT / SOAP protocol to send the report data. You may optionally enter some descriptive text that will help us to identify the context of the program crash. Then click the \<emph\>Send\</emph\> button.				20130829 23:02:48
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\error_report.xhp	0	help	par_id3149670	11			0	kid	trm15t‖You will not get an answer to your error report. If you need support, please visit the \<link href=\"text/shared/main0108.xhp\"\>support forum\</link\> on the Internet.				20130829 23:02:48
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\error_report.xhp	0	help	par_id3153526	12			0	kid	roy-j+‖You may choose to respond to questions that the developers may have about the reported error. Mark the check box if you allow to be contacted by e-mail, should additional information be required. By default this box is not marked, so you will not get any e-mail.				20130829 23:02:48
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\error_report.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150792	13			0	kid	4x0kd-‖What Data is Sent?				20130829 23:02:48
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\error_report.xhp	0	help	par_id3154366	14			0	kid	y9v8df‖The error report consists of several files. The main file contains information about the error type, operating system name and version, memory usage, and the description that you entered. You can click the \<emph\>Show Report\</emph\> button on the main dialog of the Error Report Tool to view what will get sent in the main file.				20130829 23:02:48
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\error_report.xhp	0	help	par_id3151177	15			0	kid	jtsms+‖In addition, relevant memory contents and stack traces are gathered by some system standard tools ("dbhhelp.dll" on Windows systems, "pstack" on UNIX systems). This information will be sent also.				20130829 23:02:48
