helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\05010000.xhp	0	help	par_id3156318	5			0	kid	7+j0ps‖The list boxes in the \<emph\>Fonts\</emph\> dialog display a default font for all elements. To change to a different font, click \<emph\>Modify\</emph\>, then select the element type. A new dialog box appears. Select the desired font and check any desired attributes, then click \<emph\>OK\</emph\>. To set the changes as the default fonts, click the \<emph\>Default\</emph\> button.				20130829 23:02:48
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\05010000.xhp	0	help	par_id3148831	6			0	kid	gx6udp‖If you want to mark individual text segments with a font other than that used for the whole text, then enter the \<link href=\"text/smath/01/05010000.xhp\" name=\"FONT\"\>Font\</link\> command in the \<emph\>Commands\</emph\> window.				20130829 23:02:48
