helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\05020000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150213	2			0	kid	yig726‖\<variable id=\"schriftgroessentext\"\>\<ahelp hid=\"SID_FONTSIZE\"\>Use this dialog to specify the font sizes for your formula. Select a base size and all elements of the formula will be scaled in relation to this base.\</ahelp\>\</variable\>				20130829 23:02:48
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\05020000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3146968	3			0	kid	13[3y3‖Base size				20130829 23:02:48
