helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090007.xhp	0	help	par_id3153669	3			0	kid	8bbj4m‖When you save a document that contains fields as an HTML document, $[officename] automatically converts date, time, and DocInformation fields to special HTML tags. The field contents are inserted between the opening and closing HTML tags of the converted fields. These special HTML tags do not correspond to standard HTML tags.				20130829 23:02:48
