helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02110100.xhp	0	help	par_id3155361	9			0	kid	o242ay‖With the \<emph\>Repeat search\</emph\> icon on the \<emph\>Navigation\</emph\> toolbar you can repeat a search you started with the \<emph\>Search and Replace\</emph\> dialog. To do this, click the icon. The blue arrow buttons on the vertical scrollbar now take on the functions \<emph\>Continue search forwards\</emph\> and \<emph\>Continue search backwards\</emph\>. If you now click one of the arrow surfaces, the search will be continued for the term entered in the Search and Replace dialog.				20130829 23:02:48
