helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04120212.xhp	0	help	par_id3083451	8			0	kid	1nhnvx‖\<ahelp hid=\"SW_CHECKBOX_TP_TOX_SELECT_CB_USEFF\"\>Replaces identical index entries, which occur also on the directly following page or pages, with a single entry that lists the first page number and a "p" or "pp". For example, the entries "View 10, View 11, View 12" are combined as "View 10pp", and "View 10, View 11" as "View 10p".\</ahelp\>				20130829 23:02:48
